  "body": [
    "Home",
    "Talks & presentations",
    "Live demos, conference sessions, and conversations about AI engineering, content platforms, and the way we work.",
    "September 29, 2026",
    "adaptTo() 2026 · Berlin · with Katie Phillips",
    "AI-assisted migration into DA.live and EDS, with orchestration, evaluation, and human review.",
    "September 2026",
    "adaptTo() 2026 · Berlin",
    "An eight-minute talk on a work in progress: agents that propose and validate block variants for an Edge Delivery site, then ship them through an experiment framework so both versions run live.",
    "September 11, 2026",
    "Columbus AI Week 2026, AI for Business Summit · Columbus, Ohio",
    "A fifteen-minute main stage talk on why professional services is the industry most exposed to AI. The product is knowledge work, so what AI produces is what the industry sells. Four fundamental truths about what clients buy, and how each one changes when agents do the work. Views are Jack's own.",
    "September 10, 2026",
    "Columbus AI Week 2026, AI Leadership Summit · Columbus, Ohio",
    "A featured fireside on governance that enables rather than blocks, moderated by Jim Ford with Eric Zielinski and Connie Matthews. Jack brought the view of someone who runs autonomous coding agents at night and works inside enterprise governance by day: security as layers, gates with teeth, and evals as governance.",
    "August 3, 2026",
    "AI Tinkerers Columbus · Columbus, Ohio",
    "The Company of Zero demo: one open source engine on Cloudflare Workers, a private markdown brain per company, and agents that bring me the day's work. It took second place in AI Tinkerers' global Top AI Demos that week.",
    "April 2026",
    "Denison University, CS 271 · Granville, Ohio",
    "A guest lecture with a live demo and open-source materials for computer science students.",
    "April 6, 2026",
    "AI Tinkerers Columbus · Columbus, Ohio",
    "A demo of a continuous coding agent, its execution loop, and the boundaries around autonomous work. Featured in AI Tinkerers' global Community Spotlights, picked from hundreds of demos.",
    "September 2025",
    "Columbus AI Week 2025 · Columbus, Ohio",
    "AI delivery and multi-agent collaboration in professional services.",
    "March 28, 2024",
    "Adobe Summit 2024 · Las Vegas",
    "A generative AI solution built into Adobe Experience Manager. Winner of the 2024 AEM Rockstar competition."
  ],
